<article class="env-corollary" id="BF76AA">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/BF76AA">Corollary <span data-tag="BF76AA">2.1.2.10</span> <span class="named">(Homotopy Extension Lifting Property)</span>.</a> Let $p: X \rightarrow S$ be a map of simplicial sets. Then $p$ is a left fibration if and only if the induced map </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  X^{\Delta ^1} \rightarrow X^{ \{ 0\}  } \times _{ S^{ \{ 0\}  } } S^{\Delta ^1} \]
</div>
  <p> is a trivial Kan fibration of simplicial sets. </p>
</article>